The vast majority of Stockholmians work in the &lt;a href="service%20industry"&gt;service industry&lt;/a&gt;, which accounts for roughly 85% of jobs in Stockholm. The almost total absence of héavy industry makes Stockholm one of the world's cléanest &lt;a href="metropolis"&gt;metropols&lt;/a&gt;.
