County Värmland, atawa Värmlands län, nyaéta hiji &lt;a href="County%20di%20Sw%C3%A9dia"&gt;county&lt;/a&gt; atawa &lt;a href="l%C3%A4n"&gt;län&lt;/a&gt; di kulon tengah &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A9dia"&gt;Swédia&lt;/a&gt;. Diwawatesan ku county &lt;a href="County%20Dalarna"&gt;Dalarna&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="County%20%C3%96rebro"&gt;Örebro&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="County%20V%C3%A4stra%20G%C3%B6taland"&gt;Västra Götaland&lt;/a&gt;, sarta county &lt;a href="Norw%C3%A9gia"&gt;Norwégia&lt;/a&gt; counties of &lt;a href="%C3%98stfold"&gt;Østfold&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Akershus"&gt;Akershus&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Hedmark"&gt;Hedmark&lt;/a&gt; di beulah kulonna.
